            "text": "A flaw was found in cmd/go. An attacker can exploit this by building a malicious Go source file that uses the '#cgo pkg-config:' directive. This allows the attacker to write to an arbitrary file with partial control over its content, by providing a '--log-file' argument to the pkg-config command. This vulnerability can lead to arbitrary file write.",
